OrientOS -- licensing
=====================

OrientOS is the distribution built around the Osum kernel. Everything in
this repository that was written for OrientOS is licensed under the

    GNU General Public License, version 2 only (GPL-2.0-only)

The full and unmodified text is in the file COPYING in this directory.
GPL-2.0-only was chosen deliberately so that this repository stays
compatible with the Osum kernel (https://github.com/Flei-123/Osum), which
is GPL-2.0-only as well.

  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Third party material keeps its own licence. It is listed in THIRD_PARTY.md
and is NOT covered by the paragraph above.

